'''Inflatable Boat''' (Japanese: '''ウォーターボート''' ''Water Boat'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=The Retreat Cost of the {{e|Water}} Pokémon this card is attached to is 1 less.
}}

==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Air Balloon}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card decreases the {{TCG|Retreat Cost}} by 1 instead of 2 and only works for {{e|Water}} Pokémon.

